            "review_title": "Review at Catinat Lounge",
            "review_text": "Max75\nParis, France233 contributions\n0\nPoor\nAug 2025 • Couples\nBad experience for an afternoon tea we had booked and were looking forward to.\nFriendly Welcoming but very disappointing Service by hotel standards (5 stars?!).\nMore than 30 minutes between Order and Service. The tea is served immediately..the teapot is almost empty and lukewarm when Service the dishes.\nThe quality of the dishes is also not commensurate with the place and price of the service.\nAs for tea (commercial tea scrap bags), it is clearly incomprehensible once again considering the hotel, the service (afternoon tea) and the country!\nThe staff is friendly but unprofessional..despite the many excuses for the Waiting time, we expect a commercial gesture or attention!\nIn short, to avoid..many cafes offer much better and much cheaper experiences!\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten August 10, 2025",
