            "review_title": "Review at Catinat Lounge",
            "review_text": "Van H\nSan Diego, California113 contributions\n0\nQuiet and Fine\nMar 2016 • Business\nThis lounge is good for lunch or afternoon tea/coffee if you want an oasis from the hustle and bustle of one of the busiest streets in HCM. Since staying at the Majestic on several occasions over the last few years, I have taken advantage of this lounge four or five times. There is nothing hip or even authentic? about it but is is a nice quiet atmosphere to sit for a while and watch the world go by outside the windows while you are planning your next foray into the fray. It would be a good place for a informal business meeting or a meet up with friends.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 27, 2016",
